---
import SectionIntro from "../ui/SectionIntro.astro";
---
<section class="big-picture section-sm">
  <div class="shell">
    <SectionIntro
      eyebrow=""
      title="Economic outcomes emerge from agent decisions."
      description="Agents make decisions, their actions interact with reality and with one another, and those interactions produce outcomes that can shape what happens next."
    />

    <div class="flow" role="list" aria-label="Agents, Decisions, Interactions, Outcomes, Feedback">
      <div class="flow-step" role="listitem" data-reveal>
        <span class="flow-index">01</span>
        <h3>Agents</h3>
        <p>Individuals, businesses, governments, and organizations act in relation to objectives.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="flow-step" role="listitem" data-reveal>
        <span class="flow-index">02</span>
        <h3>Decisions</h3>
        <p>Agents choose from the actions they perceive as available.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="flow-step" role="listitem" data-reveal>
        <span class="flow-index">03</span>
        <h3>Interactions</h3>
        <p>Selected actions encounter reality and other agents.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="flow-step" role="listitem" data-reveal>
        <span class="flow-index">04</span>
        <h3>Outcomes</h3>
        <p>Those interactions produce economic outcomes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="flow-step" role="listitem" data-reveal>
        <span class="flow-index">05</span>
        <h3>Feedback</h3>
        <p>Outcomes can change the conditions shaping future decisions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .big-picture {
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }

  /* Main TER flow */

  .flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .flow-step {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 13rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .flow-index {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .flow-step h3 {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 1.8vw, 1.65rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .flow-step p {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .flow-connector {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 2rem;
    align-self: center;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
  }

  .flow-connector::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -1px;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 0.3rem solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 0.3rem solid transparent;
    border-left: 0.4rem solid var(--line);
    content: "";
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .flow {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .flow-step {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .flow-connector {
      width: 1px;
      height: 1.75rem;
      flex-basis: 1.75rem;
      align-self: center;
    }

    .flow-connector::after {
      top: auto;
      right: 50%;
      bottom: -1px;
      border-top: 0.4rem solid var(--line);
      border-right: 0.3rem solid transparent;
      border-bottom: 0;
      border-left: 0.3rem solid transparent;
      transform: translateX(50%);
    }
  }
</style>
